SQL> @redundant_indexes.sql HR

=== Redundant indexes ===
PREFIX = leading columns match a wider index. DUPLICATE = same columns.
KEEP UNIQUE = unique index is a prefix of a non-unique index; do not drop
it if it enforces uniqueness.

Owner            Table                        Redundant Index                Redundant Columns                        Red. Uniq Covering Index                 Covering Columns                         Cov. Uniq  Note
---------------- ---------------------------- ------------------------------ ---------------------------------------- --------- ------------------------------ ---------------------------------------- ---------- --------------
HR               EMPLOYEES                    EMP_DEPT_IX                    DEPARTMENT_ID                            NONUNIQUE EMP_DEPT_JOB_IX                DEPARTMENT_ID, JOB_ID                    NONUNIQUE  PREFIX
HR               ORDERS                       ORD_CUST_IX                    CUSTOMER_ID                              NONUNIQUE ORD_CUST_DATE_IX               CUSTOMER_ID, ORDER_DATE                  NONUNIQUE  PREFIX
